    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\nIn the Fate Moment battlefield, Beyonders are divided into two factions. Each match lasts for <Highlight>4 minutes</>. The side with the higher score at the end of the match wins. If scores are tied, the side with more kills wins; if kills are also tied, the side with more damage wins. If all are equal, a random side wins.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Mechanism Explanation</>\n<Highlight>Score Acquisition: </>Can be obtained by picking up buff orbs, kills, assists, and entering the Vortex of Strife to compete.\n<Highlight>Gathering Anchors: </>Gathering Anchors will appear in the match and last for <Highlight>15 seconds</>. When they appear, Beyonders must enter the anchor based on the <Highlight>required number of people</>. Once the requirement is met, after <Highlight>3 seconds</>, the Beyonders of that faction will be assembled there, and participating Beyonders will receive a temporary attribute bonus.\n<Highlight>Vortex of Strife: </>A Vortex of Strife will appear in the middle of the battlefield. When the <Highlight>countdown ends</>, Beyonders remaining in the vortex will split the points equally.\n<Highlight>Buff Orbs: </>Buff orbs will appear on the battlefield. Picking them up grants <Highlight>points and attribute bonuses</>."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\nIn the Fate Moment battlefield, Потустороннийs are divided into two factions. Each match lasts for <Highlight>4 minutes</>. The side with the higher score at the end of the match wins. If scores are tied, the side with more kills wins; if kills are also tied, the side with more damage wins. If all are equal, a random side wins.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Mechanism Explanation</>\n<Highlight>Score Acquisition: </>Can be obtained by picking up buff orbs, kills, assists, and entering the Vortex of Strife to compete.\n<Highlight>Gathering Anchors: </>Gathering Anchors will appear in the match and last for <Highlight>15 seconds</>. When they appear, Потустороннийs must enter the anchor based on the <Highlight>required number of people</>. Once the requirement is met, after <Highlight>3 seconds</>, the Потустороннийs of that faction will be assembled there, and participating Потустороннийs will receive a temporary attribute bonus.\n<Highlight>Vortex of Strife: </>A Vortex of Strife will appear in the middle of the battlefield. When the <Highlight>countdown ends</>, Потустороннийs remaining in the vortex will split the points equally.\n<Highlight>Buff Orbs: </>Buff orbs will appear on the battlefield. Picking them up grants <Highlight>points and attribute bonuses</>.",
